# Copy to .env only when pointing at a deployed server.
#
# Leave both unset for local work: `npm run dev` proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:8080,
# so the page is same-origin and needs neither CORS nor a token. That works
# against a local ./build/server and against the SSH tunnel in DEPLOY.md section 9.
#
# Setting VITE_API_URL puts the token in the shipped bundle, where anyone who can
# open the page can read it. Only do this behind access you already control.

# VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
# VITE_API_TOKEN=
